 Median :6.490   Median : 0.4379   Median :0.03139  
 Mean   :6.581   Mean   : 0.4849   Mean   :0.03424  
 3rd Qu.:6.838   3rd Qu.: 0.6692   3rd Qu.:0.04127  
 Max.   :7.235   Max.   : 1.2153   Max.   :0.07198  
> print(dPEl[, .(medLppsf = median(lppsf), medElas = median(elas), nTracts = .N), keyby = w])
